      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'As you are building you will notice these cute little creatures may appear.
    These are blobs who roam through the world enjoying the calmness of not having
    to deal with time.


    Help them by building their sanctuary. There are 3 types:
    Grass, Water and Sand.


    Grass blobs need space and trees.

    Water blobs
    need a lot of water.

    Sand blobs need sand and just a palm tree or two.

'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
